WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Two letters can appear in a flash. We remember one and miss another.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Researchers call the laboratory pattern the attentional blink.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Intensive meditation training changed this measure in one 2007 study.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
That study never tested a commercial twelve-minute audio program.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
A 2023 brainwave review found inconsistent results across fourteen studies.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Choose a routine for its format. Ask for evidence before believing a promise.
